WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Two separate tones. A third rhythm you may perceive.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
That is a binaural beat. Researchers can also measure electrical responses under some lab settings.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:26.000
But a 2025 experiment did not prevent the decline in attention across a long task.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:35.000
A meditation library may still be convenient. Convenience isn't proof of a medical or cognitive result.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try a free twelve-minute session. Read the evidence before paying.
